  "status": "Refused",
  "description": "Certificate of\r\nLawful Existing Development: Use as a HMO for up to 6 persons (Use Class C4)",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;The submitted plans and tenancy agreements are inconsistent with the proposals and it has not been demonstrated that the existing use of the dwellinghouse (Class C3) as a House of Multiple Occupancy (HMO) is for up to 6 persons (Use Class C4). Therefore, it has not been demonstrated to the satisfaction of the Local Planning Authority that the existing use was within the tolerances of Class L of Part 3 of Schedule 2 of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) prior to 11th June 2026.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposal is therefore NOT a lawful development.&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
